8
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:23,800
W: Yes, could you do that for me?

9
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:27,780
If he is not there, try the second floor conference room.

10
00:00:27,985 --> 00:00:32,280
He is scheduled to give a talk to the sales staff about next week's seminar after lunch today.

11
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:36,140
He might have gone there early to test the equipment he will be using.

12
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:38,305
M: Okay, I will find him for you.
